ike (140ms -> ~1090ms) is specific to /v1/exports or all routes. Completion condition: either a correlated failed trace identifying the slow/failing span, or an explicit statement that traces remain uncorrelated and the DB metric remains non-export-specific. Do NOT change production; any remediation needs incident-lead approval (see dec_f949414ac9e4444f).\",\n          \"status\": \"open\",\n          \"assignee\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_2cada74364b54b0d\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:33:19.862Z\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 2,\n      \"returned\": 2,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"blockers\": {\n      \"items\": [],\n      \"total\": 0,\n      \"returned\": 0,\n      \"truncated\": false\n    },\n    \"artifacts\": {\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:32:52.191Z\",\n          \"id\": \"art_f2c66c6525864c88\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"type\": \"file\",\n          \"title\": \"Application trace coverage and sampled request\",\n          \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/trace-coverage.md\",\n          \"metadata\": {\n            \"incident\": \"S3\",\n            \"samplingRateApprox\": \"10pct\",\n            \"incidentDate\": \"2026-09-18\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_aa9fd1acaaf24477\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2343397d1fb7494d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:32:52.188Z\",\n          \"id\": \"art_1151c89b868042bd\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_f63f244b50b7471e\",\n          \"type\": \"file\",\n          \"title\": \"Aggregate database latency metrics\",\n      